{"kind":"request","text":"Let the Mac GitHub staging and deployment validators carry an optional validated INSTALLED_REGISTER_SCOPES setting.\n\nThis source prerequisite supports G3b configuration request 05c380ce under ruling c324ad65. prepare-github.mjs currently permits only its original default variables, five required variables and optional PLATFORM_CREATION_PINS. deploy.py prepared_project also requires an exact variable set. Both reject the installed-root setting that the reviewed G3b packet needs. Adding the setting after staging still fails deployment, so neither private-project guard may be bypassed.\n\nKeep absent-setting behavior and every existing strict variable, path, binding, private-file and App configuration check. When supplied, validate the optional list against readInstalledRegisters semantics: at most 4096 UTF-8 bytes, one to 32 distinct canonical Scope IDs, including the current REGISTER_SCOPE. Reuse the actual production parser at the JavaScript boundary before reading private App key material; keep the Python deploy boundary's equivalent validation. Preserve the setting unchanged in the staged private project. No Native authority, live register, App key, secret or deployment changes belong to this request.\n\nExtend the existing complete prepare-github Node and deploy Python owners at their real staging/deploy boundary. Preserve their original cases and checks. Run focused owners, one or two honest controls for the new invariant, and one required gate before independent review. Deliver a reviewed head on main before the G3b configuration packet exports that source. The planner stages private GitHub material and deploys.","body":{"conditions":"Land the independently approved optional installed-root Mac staging/deploy support with complete focused owner evidence, distinguishing controls and the recorded gate outcome before the G3b source export.","target_head":"ecf59e054f56528eb73f93ec4609185fe5e6a729","target_ref":"refs/heads/main","target_re